"""knowledge の設計書のスキーマで $defs/markdown を指すキーの値を、各プロジェクトの設計書から集める。"""
import json, sys
from pathlib import Path
import yaml

SCHEMAS = Path(sys.argv[1])
SRC = Path(sys.argv[2])
OUT = Path(sys.argv[3])

cache = {}
def load(name):
    if name not in cache:
        cache[name] = yaml.safe_load((SCHEMAS / name).read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
    return cache[name]

def resolve(ref, cur):
    f, _, frag = ref.partition("#")
    f = f or cur
    node = load(f)
    for part in [p for p in frag.split("/") if p]:
        node = node[part]
    return node, f, (f == "common.schema.yaml" and frag == "/$defs/markdown")

def walk(schema, cur, inst, path, out, depth=0):
    if depth > 40 or not isinstance(schema, dict):
        return
    if "$ref" in schema:
        target, f, is_md = resolve(schema["$ref"], cur)
        if is_md:
            if isinstance(inst, str):
                out.append((path, inst))
            return
        walk(target, f, inst, path, out, depth + 1)
    for key in ("allOf", "anyOf", "oneOf"):
        for sub in schema.get(key, []) or []:
            walk(sub, cur, inst, path, out, depth + 1)
    for key in ("then", "else"):
        if key in schema:
            walk(schema[key], cur, inst, path, out, depth + 1)
    if isinstance(inst, dict):
        props = schema.get("properties", {}) or {}
        for k, v in inst.items():
            if k in props:
                walk(props[k], cur, v, f"{path}.{k}", out, depth + 1)
            elif isinstance(schema.get("additionalProperties"), dict):
                walk(schema["additionalProperties"], cur, v, f"{path}.{k}", out, depth + 1)
    if isinstance(inst, list) and isinstance(schema.get("items"), dict):
        for i, v in enumerate(inst):
            walk(schema["items"], cur, v, f"{path}[{i}]", out, depth + 1)

folders = {}
for p in SCHEMAS.glob("*.schema.yaml"):
    s = load(p.name)
    if s.get("x-folder"):
        folders[s["x-folder"]] = p.name

records = []
for proj in sorted(SRC.iterdir()):
    for folder, sname in folders.items():
        base = proj / folder
        if not base.is_dir():
            continue
        for doc in sorted(base.rglob("*.yaml")):
            name = "index.schema.yaml" if doc.name == "index.yaml" else sname
            try:
                inst = yaml.safe_load(doc.read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
            except Exception as e:
                records.append({"project": proj.name, "doc": str(doc.relative_to(proj)), "error": str(e)})
                continue
            out = []
            walk(load(name), name, inst, "$", out)
            seen = set()
            for path, text in out:
                if path in seen:
                    continue
                seen.add(path)
                records.append({"project": proj.name, "doc": str(doc.relative_to(proj)), "key": path, "text": text})
OUT.write_text("\n".join(json.dumps(r, ensure_ascii=False) for r in records), encoding="utf-8")
print(len(records), "values")
# --- run.py
"""設計書ごとに本文の値をつなげて mdmark check --text で点検し、警告を値へ戻す。"""
import json, subprocess, sys, re
from collections import defaultdict
from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor
MDMARK = sys.argv[1]; VALUES = sys.argv[2]; OUT = sys.argv[3]
docs = defaultdict(list)
for line in open(VALUES, encoding="utf-8"):
    r = json.loads(line)
    if "text" in r:
        docs[(r["project"], r["doc"])].append((r["key"], r["text"]))
LINE = re.compile(r"^-:(\d+):\s*(\S+?):\s*(.*)$")
def check(item):
    (proj, doc), vals = item
    parts, spans, n = [], [], 1
    for key, text in vals:
        body = text.rstrip("\n")
        cnt = body.count("\n") + 1
        spans.append((n, n + cnt - 1, key))
        parts.append(body)
        n += cnt + 1
    p = subprocess.run([MDMARK, "check", "--text", "-"], input="\n\n".join(parts) + "\n", capture_output=True, text=True)
    found = []
    for l in p.stdout.splitlines() + p.stderr.splitlines():
        m = LINE.match(l)
        if not m:
            continue
        ln = int(m[1]); key = next((k for a, b, k in spans if a <= ln <= b), "?")
        found.append({"project": proj, "doc": doc, "key": key, "code": m[2], "message": m[3]})
    return found, p.returncode, len(vals)
res = []
with ThreadPoolExecutor(6) as ex:
    for found, rc, nv in ex.map(check, docs.items()):
        res.extend(found)
json.dump(res, open(OUT, "w", encoding="utf-8"), ensure_ascii=False, indent=1)
print(len(docs), "docs", len(res), "findings")
